{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-patches","title":"经典音色复现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/classic-patches","wordCount":2048,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"经典音色复现\">经典音色复现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复现经典音色是建立&quot;听觉分析 → 参数决策&quot;直觉的最有效训练。它的核心思路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分析→合成→对比三步循环</strong>：先聆听分析目标，再尝试重建，最后 A/B 对比定位偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>价值在过程而非还原度</strong>：受限于硬件/软件差异，100% 还原并非目标，分析能力才是收获。</li>\n<li><strong>经典音色各有标志性特征</strong>：Minimoog Bass 的厚度、DX7 电钢的金属泛音、Supersaw 的宽立体声都源自可拆解的参数组合。</li>\n<li><strong>不同合成方法对应不同复现路径</strong>：减法、FM、波表、Unison 各有其关键参数与陷阱。</li>\n<li><strong>练习遵循指数进步曲线</strong>：初期进步快、后期精细差异难辨，需靠记录与回顾持续逼近。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要复现经典音色\">为什么要复现经典音色</h2><p>复现经典音色是合成器学习的核心训练方法。当你尝试从零开始重建一个已知的声音时，必须精确分析其频谱构成、动态行为和时间演变——这个过程比任何教程都更有效地建立&quot;声音特征 → 合成参数&quot;的直觉映射：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Learning</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Analysis</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Target</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Synthesis</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Attempt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Comparison</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Learning} = \\text{Analysis}(\\text{Target}) + \\text{Synthesis}(\\text{Attempt}) + \\text{Comparison}(\\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Learning</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Analysis</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Target</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Synthesis</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Attempt</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Comparison</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>复现练习的价值不在于100%还原原版（这受限于具体硬件/软件差异），而在于过程中获得的分析能力和参数控制直觉。一次完整的复现练习通常包含几个环节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>反复聆听原版，抓住最突出的几个听觉特征</li>\n<li>用频谱与动态分析把特征拆解为可测量的参数线索</li>\n<li>在合成器上从最少声源出发逐步重建</li>\n<li>A/B 切换对比定位偏差，迭代修正逼近目标</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>经典音色</th>\n<th>年代</th>\n<th>合成方法</th>\n<th>标志性特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Minimoog Bass</td>\n<td>1970s</td>\n<td>减法合成</td>\n<td>厚重低频/滤波器驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DX7 Electric Piano</td>\n<td>1980s</td>\n<td>FM 合成</td>\n<td>金属质感/Bell-like 泛音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JP-8000 Supersaw</td>\n<td>1990s</td>\n<td>Unison 叠加</td>\n<td>超宽立体声/Trance Lead</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPG Wavetable Pad</td>\n<td>1980s</td>\n<td>波表扫描</td>\n<td>缓慢演变/数字质感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TB-303 Acid Line</td>\n<td>1980s</td>\n<td>减法合成</td>\n<td>高谐振/Accent/滑音</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 分析[&quot;目标分析&quot;]&#10;        L[&quot;聆听原版&lt;br/&gt;反复试听关键特征&quot;]&#10;        F[&quot;频谱分析&lt;br/&gt;基频/谐波/噪声&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;动态分析&lt;br/&gt;Attack/Sustain/Release&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 实现[&quot;复现流程&quot;]&#10;        O[&quot;振荡器配置&lt;br/&gt;波形/叠加/Detune&quot;]&#10;        FI[&quot;滤波器设置&lt;br/&gt;类型/Cutoff/Reso&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;包络设计&lt;br/&gt;Amp/Filter ADSR&quot;]&#10;        M[&quot;调制分配&lt;br/&gt;LFO/Env目标&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 验证[&quot;A/B 验证&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;切换对比&lt;br/&gt;原版 vs 复现&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;差异分析&lt;br/&gt;定位偏差来源&quot;]&#10;        I[&quot;修正迭代&lt;br/&gt;逐步逼近&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    L --&gt; F --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; O --&gt; FI --&gt; E --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; C --&gt; A --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; O\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 分析[\"目标分析\"]\n        L[\"聆听原版&lt;br/&gt;反复试听关键特征\"]\n        F[\"频谱分析&lt;br/&gt;基频/谐波/噪声\"]\n        D[\"动态分析&lt;br/&gt;Attack/Sustain/Release\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 实现[\"复现流程\"]\n        O[\"振荡器配置&lt;br/&gt;波形/叠加/Detune\"]\n        FI[\"滤波器设置&lt;br/&gt;类型/Cutoff/Reso\"]\n        E[\"包络设计&lt;br/&gt;Amp/Filter ADSR\"]\n        M[\"调制分配&lt;br/&gt;LFO/Env目标\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 验证[\"A/B 验证\"]\n        C[\"切换对比&lt;br/&gt;原版 vs 复现\"]\n        A[\"差异分析&lt;br/&gt;定位偏差来源\"]\n        I[\"修正迭代&lt;br/&gt;逐步逼近\"]\n    end\n    L --&gt; F --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; O --&gt; FI --&gt; E --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; C --&gt; A --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; O</pre><h2 id=\"模拟-bass-音色复现\">模拟 Bass 音色复现</h2><p>模拟 Bass（Analog Bass）是最基础也最重要的复现练习。以经典 Minimoog 风格 Bass 为目标，其核心特征是：丰满的低频基础、适度的谐波饱和、快速的瞬态响应：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>65.41</mn><mtext>Hz (C2)</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>谐波衰减</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>0.8</mn></msup></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>谐波序号</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0 = 65.41\\text{Hz (C2)}, \\quad \\text{谐波衰减} \\propto \\frac{1}{n^{0.8}} \\quad (n = \\text{谐波序号})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65.41</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz (C2)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">谐波衰减</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">谐波序号</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与纯数学模型不同，模拟 Bass 的谐波衰减比正弦波缓慢（指数约 0.8 而非整数），这赋予其&quot;肥厚&quot;的质感。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数模块</th>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OSC 1</td>\n<td>Saw，16&#39; 或 8&#39;</td>\n<td>提供丰富谐波基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSC 2</td>\n<td>Square，低 1 octave</td>\n<td>增强低频基波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSC Mix</td>\n<td>60:40（Saw 为主）</td>\n<td>谐波丰富但低频扎实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter Type</td>\n<td>24dB/oct Ladder LP</td>\n<td>经典 Moog 滤波器特性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter Cutoff</td>\n<td>约 400–800Hz</td>\n<td>保留低频去除刺耳高频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter Env Amount</td>\n<td>30–50%</td>\n<td>瞬态时短暂打开滤波器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter ADSR</td>\n<td>A:0, D:200ms, S:20%, R:50ms</td>\n<td>快速衰减的&quot;咔&quot;感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amp ADSR</td>\n<td>A:2ms, D:0, S:100%, R:80ms</td>\n<td>近乎即时的起音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drive/Saturation</td>\n<td>轻微过载</td>\n<td>增加谐波饱和度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 振荡器[&quot;振荡器组&quot;]&#10;        O1[&quot;OSC1: Saw&lt;br/&gt;8 foot&quot;]&#10;        O2[&quot;OSC2: Square&lt;br/&gt;16 foot&quot;]&#10;        MX[&quot;Mixer&lt;br/&gt;60:40&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 滤波[&quot;滤波器&quot;]&#10;        LP[&quot;Ladder LP&lt;br/&gt;24dB/oct&quot;]&#10;        FC[&quot;Cutoff: 600Hz&lt;br/&gt;Reso: 15%&quot;]&#10;        FE[&quot;Filter Env&lt;br/&gt;D:200ms Amt:40%&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;输出&quot;]&#10;        AE[&quot;Amp Env&lt;br/&gt;A:2ms S:100%&quot;]&#10;        DR[&quot;Drive&lt;br/&gt;Light Sat&quot;]&#10;        OUT[&quot;Output&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    O1 --&gt; MX&#10;    O2 --&gt; MX&#10;    MX --&gt; LP&#10;    FC --&gt; LP&#10;    FE --&gt; LP&#10;    LP --&gt; AE&#10;    AE --&gt; DR&#10;    DR --&gt; OUT\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 振荡器[\"振荡器组\"]\n        O1[\"OSC1: Saw&lt;br/&gt;8 foot\"]\n        O2[\"OSC2: Square&lt;br/&gt;16 foot\"]\n        MX[\"Mixer&lt;br/&gt;60:40\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 滤波[\"滤波器\"]\n        LP[\"Ladder LP&lt;br/&gt;24dB/oct\"]\n        FC[\"Cutoff: 600Hz&lt;br/&gt;Reso: 15%\"]\n        FE[\"Filter Env&lt;br/&gt;D:200ms Amt:40%\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"输出\"]\n        AE[\"Amp Env&lt;br/&gt;A:2ms S:100%\"]\n        DR[\"Drive&lt;br/&gt;Light Sat\"]\n        OUT[\"Output\"]\n    end\n    O1 --&gt; MX\n    O2 --&gt; MX\n    MX --&gt; LP\n    FC --&gt; LP\n    FE --&gt; LP\n    LP --&gt; AE\n    AE --&gt; DR\n    DR --&gt; OUT</pre><p>关键细节：Minimoog Bass 的标志性&quot;胖&quot;感来自三个因素——多振荡器之间的微小 Detune（约 2–5 cents）产生的 Beating、Ladder Filter 在高 Resonance 时的自激振荡倾向、以及模拟电路固有的轻微非线性失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字-pad-音色复现\">数字 Pad 音色复现</h2><p>数字 Pad（Digital Pad）以缓慢演变的宽广质感为特征，PPG Wave 和 Roland D-50 时代的 Pad 代表了这一美学。核心在于利用波表扫描或 PWM 创造缓慢变化的频谱：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>where </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>wavetable position slowly swept</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t) = \\sum_{k} A_k(t) \\cdot W_k[\\phi(t)] \\quad \\text{where } k = \\text{wavetable position slowly swept}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">where </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">wavetable position slowly swept</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>波表位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 随时间缓慢移动，使音色在持续音阶段不断演变而非静态保持。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数模块</th>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OSC 1</td>\n<td>Wavetable / PWM Saw</td>\n<td>频谱可演变的声源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSC 2</td>\n<td>Sine 或 Triangle</td>\n<td>提供底部支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unison</td>\n<td>4–8 voice, Detune 15–25ct</td>\n<td>宽广立体声场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter</td>\n<td>LP 12dB/oct, Cutoff 3–6kHz</td>\n<td>柔和高频/保留空气感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amp ADSR</td>\n<td>A:500ms, D:0, S:100%, R:2s</td>\n<td>缓入缓出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter ADSR</td>\n<td>A:3s, D:0, S:80%, R:1s</td>\n<td>极慢的频谱展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO 1</td>\n<td>Sine, 0.1Hz → WT Position</td>\n<td>缓慢波表扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO 2</td>\n<td>Triangle, 0.3Hz → Pitch ±3ct</td>\n<td>轻微 Detune 动感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reverb</td>\n<td>Hall, Decay 4–6s, Mix 40%</td>\n<td>空间深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chorus</td>\n<td>Slow Rate, Depth 30%</td>\n<td>额外宽度和运动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 声源[&quot;声源层&quot;]&#10;        WT[&quot;OSC1: Wavetable&lt;br/&gt;Slow Sweep&quot;]&#10;        SI[&quot;OSC2: Sine&lt;br/&gt;-1 Oct Sub&quot;]&#10;        UN[&quot;Unison x6&lt;br/&gt;Detune 20ct&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 调制[&quot;调制系统&quot;]&#10;        L1[&quot;LFO1: 0.1Hz&lt;br/&gt;WT Position&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;LFO2: 0.3Hz&lt;br/&gt;Pitch微调&quot;]&#10;        FE[&quot;Filter Env&lt;br/&gt;A:3s 慢展开&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 处理[&quot;信号处理&quot;]&#10;        FLT[&quot;LP 12dB&lt;br/&gt;Cutoff 4kHz&quot;]&#10;        CH[&quot;Chorus&lt;br/&gt;增加宽度&quot;]&#10;        RV[&quot;Reverb Hall&lt;br/&gt;Decay 5s&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    WT --&gt; UN&#10;    SI --&gt; UN&#10;    UN --&gt; FLT&#10;    L1 --&gt; WT&#10;    L2 --&gt; WT&#10;    FE --&gt; FLT&#10;    FLT --&gt; CH --&gt; RV\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 声源[\"声源层\"]\n        WT[\"OSC1: Wavetable&lt;br/&gt;Slow Sweep\"]\n        SI[\"OSC2: Sine&lt;br/&gt;-1 Oct Sub\"]\n        UN[\"Unison x6&lt;br/&gt;Detune 20ct\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 调制[\"调制系统\"]\n        L1[\"LFO1: 0.1Hz&lt;br/&gt;WT Position\"]\n        L2[\"LFO2: 0.3Hz&lt;br/&gt;Pitch微调\"]\n        FE[\"Filter Env&lt;br/&gt;A:3s 慢展开\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 处理[\"信号处理\"]\n        FLT[\"LP 12dB&lt;br/&gt;Cutoff 4kHz\"]\n        CH[\"Chorus&lt;br/&gt;增加宽度\"]\n        RV[\"Reverb Hall&lt;br/&gt;Decay 5s\"]\n    end\n    WT --&gt; UN\n    SI --&gt; UN\n    UN --&gt; FLT\n    L1 --&gt; WT\n    L2 --&gt; WT\n    FE --&gt; FLT\n    FLT --&gt; CH --&gt; RV</pre><p>Pad 设计的核心哲学是&quot;缓慢的一切&quot;——Attack 缓慢、调制缓慢、频谱演变缓慢。急促的参数变化会破坏 Pad 应有的空灵感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fm-铃声与金属音色复现\">FM 铃声与金属音色复现</h2><p>FM 合成的标志性音色是 DX7 时代的 Electric Piano 和 Bell 音色。这些音色以非谐波泛音结构（钟声般的金属感）为标志，通过调频比率偏离整数倍来实现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = A_c \\sin\\left(2\\pi f_c t + I \\cdot \\sin(2\\pi f_m t)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>频谱成分</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>±</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{频谱成分} = f_c \\pm n \\cdot f_m, \\quad n = 0, 1, 2, \\ldots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">频谱成分</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当载波频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与调制频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的比率为简单整数比时产生谐波音色；比率为无理数时产生非谐波的金属/钟声质感。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>Bell 音色设置</th>\n<th>E.Piano 设置</th>\n<th>差异原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C:M Ratio</td>\n<td>1:1.414</td>\n<td>1:1</td>\n<td>非整数比产生不和谐泛音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mod Index</td>\n<td>3–5</td>\n<td>1.5–3</td>\n<td>更高 Index 更多泛音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mod Env</td>\n<td>D:2–4s, S:0</td>\n<td>D:300ms, S:10%</td>\n<td>Bell 缓慢衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carrier Env</td>\n<td>D:3–6s, S:0</td>\n<td>D:1s, S:30%</td>\n<td>Bell 自然衰减/EP 有 Sustain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feedback</td>\n<td>0–10%</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>轻微反馈增加噪声成分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Velocity</td>\n<td>强力→高 Index</td>\n<td>强力→高 Index</td>\n<td>两者都响应力度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Op配置[&quot;FM 算子配置&quot;]&#10;        M1[&quot;Modulator&lt;br/&gt;Ratio: 1.414&lt;br/&gt;Index: 4&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;Carrier&lt;br/&gt;Ratio: 1.0&lt;br/&gt;Output&quot;]&#10;        ME[&quot;Mod Env&lt;br/&gt;D:3s S:0&quot;]&#10;        CE[&quot;Carrier Env&lt;br/&gt;D:5s S:0&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 声音特征[&quot;输出特征&quot;]&#10;        SP[&quot;频谱:&lt;br/&gt;非谐波泛音组&quot;]&#10;        DY[&quot;动态:&lt;br/&gt;Index随力度变化&quot;]&#10;        TM[&quot;时间:&lt;br/&gt;泛音先衰减&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    ME --&gt; M1&#10;    M1 --&gt;|FM| C1&#10;    CE --&gt; C1&#10;    C1 --&gt; SP&#10;    C1 --&gt; DY&#10;    C1 --&gt; TM\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Op配置[\"FM 算子配置\"]\n        M1[\"Modulator&lt;br/&gt;Ratio: 1.414&lt;br/&gt;Index: 4\"]\n        C1[\"Carrier&lt;br/&gt;Ratio: 1.0&lt;br/&gt;Output\"]\n        ME[\"Mod Env&lt;br/&gt;D:3s S:0\"]\n        CE[\"Carrier Env&lt;br/&gt;D:5s S:0\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 声音特征[\"输出特征\"]\n        SP[\"频谱:&lt;br/&gt;非谐波泛音组\"]\n        DY[\"动态:&lt;br/&gt;Index随力度变化\"]\n        TM[\"时间:&lt;br/&gt;泛音先衰减\"]\n    end\n    ME --&gt; M1\n    M1 --&gt;|FM| C1\n    CE --&gt; C1\n    C1 --&gt; SP\n    C1 --&gt; DY\n    C1 --&gt; TM</pre><p>FM 钟声的关键细节：Modulation Index 的衰减速度比 Carrier Amplitude 更快——这意味着音色在发声后先失去高频泛音（变得更&quot;纯净&quot;），然后整体音量才衰减。这个&quot;泛音先走、基频后走&quot;的特征是 Bell 音色最重要的听觉标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tb-303-acid-bass-复现\">TB-303 Acid Bass 复现</h2><p>Roland TB-303 的 Acid Bass 是电子音乐历史上最具标志性的合成器音色之一。其独特的&quot;酸性&quot;质感来自高谐振滤波器、滑音（Glide）和重音（Accent）的交互：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>Q</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> (high resonance)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(f) = \\frac{1}{1 - (f/f_c)^2 + j \\cdot (f/f_c)/Q}, \\quad Q \\gg 1 \\text{ (high resonance)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (high resonance)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 Q 值极高时，滤波器在截止频率处产生尖锐的共振峰，这就是 303 标志性&quot;尖叫&quot;声的来源。Accent 触发时同时提升音量和 Cutoff，产生突出的、带有滤波器尖叫的音符。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>正常音符</th>\n<th>Accent 音符</th>\n<th>变化原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Filter Cutoff</td>\n<td>基础值</td>\n<td>+30–50%</td>\n<td>Accent 打开滤波器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resonance</td>\n<td>70–85%</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>始终高谐振</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Envelope Decay</td>\n<td>200–400ms</td>\n<td>100–200ms</td>\n<td>Accent 缩短衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amp Level</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>+6–10dB</td>\n<td>Accent 增加音量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Glide</td>\n<td>Off/On</td>\n<td>On</td>\n<td>滑音 60–120ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 音序[&quot;音序器控制&quot;]&#10;        N[&quot;Note&lt;br/&gt;C2/D2/E2...&quot;]&#10;        AC[&quot;Accent&lt;br/&gt;On/Off&quot;]&#10;        GL[&quot;Glide&lt;br/&gt;On/Off&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 合成[&quot;合成引擎&quot;]&#10;        OSC[&quot;Saw Wave&lt;br/&gt;Single OSC&quot;]&#10;        FLT[&quot;18dB LP&lt;br/&gt;High Reso&quot;]&#10;        ENV[&quot;Decay Env&lt;br/&gt;单段衰减&quot;]&#10;        AMP[&quot;VCA&lt;br/&gt;+Accent Boost&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;输出特征&quot;]&#10;        ACF[&quot;酸性尖叫&lt;br/&gt;Reso + Env Sweep&quot;]&#10;        GLS[&quot;滑音连接&lt;br/&gt;Portamento&quot;]&#10;        DIS[&quot;过载失真&lt;br/&gt;可选&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    N --&gt; OSC&#10;    AC --&gt; ENV&#10;    AC --&gt; AMP&#10;    GL --&gt; OSC&#10;    OSC --&gt; FLT&#10;    ENV --&gt; FLT&#10;    FLT --&gt; AMP&#10;    AMP --&gt; ACF&#10;    AMP --&gt; GLS&#10;    AMP --&gt; DIS\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 音序[\"音序器控制\"]\n        N[\"Note&lt;br/&gt;C2/D2/E2...\"]\n        AC[\"Accent&lt;br/&gt;On/Off\"]\n        GL[\"Glide&lt;br/&gt;On/Off\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 合成[\"合成引擎\"]\n        OSC[\"Saw Wave&lt;br/&gt;Single OSC\"]\n        FLT[\"18dB LP&lt;br/&gt;High Reso\"]\n        ENV[\"Decay Env&lt;br/&gt;单段衰减\"]\n        AMP[\"VCA&lt;br/&gt;+Accent Boost\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"输出特征\"]\n        ACF[\"酸性尖叫&lt;br/&gt;Reso + Env Sweep\"]\n        GLS[\"滑音连接&lt;br/&gt;Portamento\"]\n        DIS[\"过载失真&lt;br/&gt;可选\"]\n    end\n    N --&gt; OSC\n    AC --&gt; ENV\n    AC --&gt; AMP\n    GL --&gt; OSC\n    OSC --&gt; FLT\n    ENV --&gt; FLT\n    FLT --&gt; AMP\n    AMP --&gt; ACF\n    AMP --&gt; GLS\n    AMP --&gt; DIS</pre><p>303 复现的难点在于其独特的滤波器拓扑（18dB/oct 而非标准的 12 或 24）和 Accent 电路的非线性行为。现代软件合成器中，专门的 303 模拟插件（如 ABL3、Phoscyon）通过电路建模实现这些细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复现练习的方法论总结\">复现练习的方法论总结</h2><p>经典音色复现不是死记硬背参数列表，而是通过反复实践建立&quot;听觉分析 → 参数决策&quot;的快速通道。每次复现后的回顾和总结比结果本身更有学习价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复现阶段</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n<th>正确方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分析阶段</td>\n<td>跳过聆听直接看参数</td>\n<td>先反复听 30s 再动手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>振荡器</td>\n<td>叠加太多声源追求&quot;厚&quot;</td>\n<td>从最少声源出发逐步加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滤波器</td>\n<td>只调 Cutoff 忽略 Env</td>\n<td>Cutoff 和 Env Amount 协同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包络</td>\n<td>ADSR 各段同时调</td>\n<td>先定 Attack 再定 Decay</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>过早加 Reverb 掩盖问题</td>\n<td>干声满意后再加效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>长时间听同一版本</td>\n<td>频繁 A/B 切换保持客观</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>掌握度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>practice</mtext></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{掌握度} = 1 - e^{-\\lambda \\cdot N_{\\text{practice}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">掌握度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">practice</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每次复现练习都在指数逼近完全掌握——初期进步快（低垂果实多），后期进步慢（精细差异难感知）。坚持练习、记录心得、定期回顾是持续进步的保证。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经典音色复现","id":"经典音色复现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要复现经典音色","id":"为什么要复现经典音色"},{"level":2,"text":"模拟 Bass 音色复现","id":"模拟-bass-音色复现"},{"level":2,"text":"数字 Pad 音色复现","id":"数字-pad-音色复现"},{"level":2,"text":"FM 铃声与金属音色复现","id":"fm-铃声与金属音色复现"},{"level":2,"text":"TB-303 Acid Bass 复现","id":"tb-303-acid-bass-复现"},{"level":2,"text":"复现练习的方法论总结","id":"复现练习的方法论总结"}],"prev":{"title":"音色设计工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/design-workflow"},"next":{"title":"创意音色设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/creative-design"}}